WEBVTT

00:01:55.414 --> 00:01:58.769
What?! You asked the manager
to go out on a date with me?!

00:01:59.651 --> 00:02:01.770
Aren't you happy, Yusaku?

00:02:02.879 --> 00:02:03.930
What a thing to do!

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:07.719
I'm a college student!
I'll make my own dates!

00:02:07.790 --> 00:02:09.282
You don't have the guts.

00:02:13.662 --> 00:02:16.450
I have my pride!

00:02:16.600 --> 00:02:19.361
Don't worry. The manager
was happy to accept.

00:02:23.169 --> 00:02:25.430
You're lying!
I'll go and cancel.

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:26.662
Wait, Yusaku!

00:02:27.312 --> 00:02:30.300
I don't want you making
my dates for me!

00:02:31.008 --> 00:02:32.629
Stop being a busybody!

00:02:45.129 --> 00:02:46.251
Hi, Godai.

00:02:46.730 --> 00:02:49.588
I hear Grandma made
a strange request.

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:53.219
What do you mean?
Oh, that!

00:02:53.629 --> 00:02:54.990
What was Grandma
thinking, anyway!

00:02:55.068 --> 00:02:56.331
I'm looking forward to it.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:57.251
Huh?!

00:02:57.501 --> 00:03:00.400
I'm looking forward
to this Sunday.

00:03:03.212 --> 00:03:05.040
Did you want to tell me
something about that?

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:08.068
Well...

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:11.240
I'm looking forward
to it, too!

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.391
You don't have to see us off!

00:03:31.568 --> 00:03:34.758
This is how I want you two
to spend your day.

00:03:36.141 --> 00:03:36.730
Take it.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:45.950
What's this?

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.752
Your itinerary.

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:49.781
That's ridiculous!

00:03:50.318 --> 00:03:52.370
Look after him for me.

00:03:53.062 --> 00:03:57.361
All right.
We'll be going now, Grandma.

00:03:59.031 --> 00:04:01.191
Wait! Could you walk
arm-in-arm?

00:04:01.602 --> 00:04:03.150
Grandma!
That's being rude!

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:05.562
Let's go!

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.912
Don't take her seriously.

00:04:23.422 --> 00:04:24.511
S-Sorry!

00:04:27.261 --> 00:04:28.451
Shall we be on our way?

00:04:33.931 --> 00:04:34.893
Coming!

00:04:54.893 --> 00:04:56.051
It's over between us.

00:04:59.191 --> 00:05:02.090
Wait! You haven't heard
what I have to say.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.732
I can't take it any longer!

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:07.251
Good-bye!

00:05:08.102 --> 00:05:09.063
Don't go!

00:05:23.551 --> 00:05:25.951
What am I to do?!

00:05:31.090 --> 00:05:33.821
I'm sorry... Grandma likes
these kinds of movies.

00:05:33.963 --> 00:05:35.862
I understand.

00:05:49.143 --> 00:05:49.931
Yotsuya!

00:05:50.542 --> 00:05:53.732
Young Godai! What're the two
of you doing here?

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.713
That's what I should
be asking you!

00:05:56.381 --> 00:05:57.172
Hey...

00:05:58.751 --> 00:06:00.080
Keep it down, okay?

00:06:02.621 --> 00:06:03.313
Sorry.

00:06:03.821 --> 00:06:06.412
This is quite a surprise.

00:06:06.963 --> 00:06:09.982
If you hadn't called my name,
I wouldn't have even noticed you.

00:06:10.201 --> 00:06:13.261
You weren't shy about
grabbing the popcorn.

00:06:13.602 --> 00:06:15.761
This is how I always do it.

00:06:16.371 --> 00:06:18.491
Stop that!
This is ours!

00:06:18.813 --> 00:06:20.862
Don't be stingy.

00:06:21.583 --> 00:06:23.241
Keep it quiet, I said.

00:06:25.551 --> 00:06:27.602
We're very sorry.

00:06:33.792 --> 00:06:36.083
Yotsuya, give us back
our popcorn!

00:06:36.292 --> 00:06:41.222
Forgive me. Want some?
I'd be happy to share.

00:06:45.602 --> 00:06:47.121
Let's get out of here,
Manager.

00:06:47.333 --> 00:06:48.381
But...

00:06:48.472 --> 00:06:50.590
You'll miss the
interesting part.

00:06:51.071 --> 00:06:52.862
You stay here until it finishes!

00:06:57.340 --> 00:06:58.801
Come back to me!

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:11.941
This is so cute!

00:08:19.431 --> 00:08:23.230
Godai, it transforms when
you push this button.

00:08:23.562 --> 00:08:26.023
And watch when I push
this button.

00:08:27.970 --> 00:08:28.662
See!

00:09:18.152 --> 00:09:19.509
Her laughter is so
carefree...

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:37.902
They've already put out
Christmas displays.

00:09:38.912 --> 00:09:39.960
It seems so early.

00:09:41.382 --> 00:09:42.273
So true.

00:09:47.882 --> 00:09:49.172
Hi, Godai.

00:09:51.023 --> 00:09:51.882
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:09:54.152 --> 00:09:55.672
What brings the two
of you here?

00:09:56.023 --> 00:09:57.610
Why are YOU here?

00:09:58.061 --> 00:10:02.009
I thought I'd buy
something for Kentaro.

00:10:02.460 --> 00:10:05.750
Mom, I want this one.

00:10:06.172 --> 00:10:07.061
Okay...

00:10:10.603 --> 00:10:12.191
Big Brother Godai and Manager...

00:10:13.441 --> 00:10:15.773
Why are you two together?

00:10:16.782 --> 00:10:18.109
Pay for that with this.

00:10:23.353 --> 00:10:24.941
Have you been here all along?

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:25.882
Of course.

00:10:29.123 --> 00:10:30.451
We have to be going.

00:10:32.532 --> 00:10:33.181
Godai!

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:36.623
See you later, Mrs. Ichinose.

00:10:38.873 --> 00:10:39.960
'Bye!

00:10:54.451 --> 00:10:55.811
Don't you think it's odd?

00:10:56.580 --> 00:10:57.233
Huh?

00:10:57.623 --> 00:11:00.951
Mrs. Ichinose didn't
even try to tease us.

00:11:01.893 --> 00:11:04.681
Something's going on. The timing
is too much of a coincidence.

00:11:05.032 --> 00:11:06.191
I think we're being followed.

00:11:06.393 --> 00:11:08.109
That's silly! They have better
things to do than follow us.

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:11.609
Come on!

00:11:11.701 --> 00:11:13.061
Godai!

00:11:43.330 --> 00:11:45.893
Godai... I think it's
just your imagination.

00:11:57.643 --> 00:12:02.330
If it isn't Godai!
Here for lunch?

00:12:02.623 --> 00:12:04.739
Imagine seeing the two of
you at a place like this!

00:12:05.321 --> 00:12:08.311
What a coincidence.
Are the two of you together, too?

00:12:08.720 --> 00:12:12.340
Master always takes
me to lunch.

00:12:12.632 --> 00:12:15.061
I come here all the time.

00:12:16.632 --> 00:12:18.152
Is that so?

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:10.780
Shall we eat?

00:13:11.180 --> 00:13:12.230
Sure.

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:16.200
How nice!
Lunch reservations for two!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.060
I hear they're on a date.

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:22.070
Do you still think
it's a coincidence?

00:13:22.140 --> 00:13:25.470
The master wouldn't play
along with a practical joke.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:28.870
A date, you say?
Good for Godai!

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.970
No, it was charity!

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:33.580
Grandma and the manager
took pity on Godai.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.490
Godai...

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:36.920
Manager...

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:37.810
Yes?

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:39.950
Let's get out of here.

00:13:48.400 --> 00:13:49.330
All right.

00:13:53.880 --> 00:13:56.330
We're supposed to be at
Cafe Classics at 3:00 p.m.

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:21.100
Aren't you getting
thirsty, Godai?

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.200
Shall we go, then?

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:38.740
Welcome!

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:46.920
Please take a table.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:49.880
We're looking for
some people.

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:52.770
Shall I have them paged?

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:56.900
No, don't bother.
Just go about your work.

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:15.050
They're getting away--
After them!

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.050
I think we've finally
Iost them.

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:06.960
Your change is 600 yen
from 1000 yen.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.970
Thank you very much!

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:49.420
Found 'em!

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:56.470
Sake Denpata

00:18:06.500 --> 00:18:11.830
Come one, come all! Try our
newest sake, "Denpata"!

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:14.960
This way!

00:18:17.670 --> 00:18:19.570
Mom, I'm pooped!

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:20.700
Save it!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:23.290
Come one, come all!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:27.540
Try our proud new addition to
our sake family, "Denpata"!

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:31.640
Godai, this way!

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:41.330
Try our proud new addition to
our sake family, "Denpata"!

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:47.420
Care to try our new
Denpata sake, ma'am?

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:50.360
All right,
maybe just a taste.

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:51.570
Me, too.

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:53.630
Thank you very much!

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:56.040
Mom, I'm pooped!

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:57.920
We'll be going home soon,
so just wait.

00:18:58.980 --> 00:19:01.770
Can I get your son
some juice?

00:19:01.920 --> 00:19:03.210
That'd be nice.

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.600
What about Godai and
the manager?

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:10.670
Don't worry. Yotsuya
will take care of it.

00:19:12.330 --> 00:19:13.080
You're right.

00:19:15.030 --> 00:19:16.180
What do you think?

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:19.590
What brand do you usually
drink at home?

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:25.350
Me? I usually drink "Hazakura,"
but this is good, too.

00:19:25.430 --> 00:19:27.460
I can tell you know
your drinks, ma'am!

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.850
Young Godai...

00:20:03.280 --> 00:20:04.330
Oh my...

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:59.120
I don't think Mr. Yotsuya
and the others are following us anymore.

00:20:59.470 --> 00:21:00.990
I think you're right.

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:05.030
Thank you so much for
going out with me.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:07.230
I had so much fun...

00:21:12.780 --> 00:21:16.300
I enjoyed it so much.
It was like a game.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:17.370
Yes, it was.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.700
Shouldn't we be heading back?

00:21:42.170 --> 00:21:43.540
Yes, you're right.

00:22:17.210 --> 00:22:18.920
What?! No hope?

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:21.860
Afraid not.
I followed them secretly.

00:22:22.050 --> 00:22:24.540
They seemed very bored
at the theater.

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:27.710
All they did was look at toys.
They hardly even talked.

00:22:28.020 --> 00:22:31.920
and left right away.

00:22:32.060 --> 00:22:34.380
And then they ran
all over town.

00:22:34.620 --> 00:22:37.030
They had nothing better to do.

00:22:37.420 --> 00:22:40.720
Too bad it didn't work out
before you left.

00:22:42.470 --> 00:22:45.620
Let us take care of the rest.

00:22:56.050 --> 00:22:56.910
I'm home.

00:22:59.110 --> 00:23:03.480
What's the matter, Grandma?
You don't look very happy.

00:23:11.470 --> 00:23:16.270
I tried so hard to play
Cupid... Loser!

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:50.690
Akemi!

00:23:50.980 --> 00:23:55.420
As Godai's landlady, I can't
condone your behavior!

00:23:56.060 --> 00:24:00.150
Next: "A Kiss is Just a Kiss...
But a Woman's Love is Priceless"

00:24:00.900 --> 00:24:05.250
As the sound of the harbor horns
fades into the fog,

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:06.380
what will become of Akemi?
